+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/CRKN> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Mudstone, sandstone and siltstone with subsidiary limestone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs both onshore and offshore. Deposited during the Berriasian Age - to - Cenomanian Age (Cretaceous Period) (143.1-93.9 Ma BP)."@en .
+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/HMBG> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Mudstone and sandstone and trace coal and limestone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs offshore. Deposited during the Bajocian Age (Jurassic Period) - to - Berriasian Age (Cretaceous Period) (170.9-137.7 Ma BP)."@en .
+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/STLN> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Mudstone with subsidiary limestone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs offshore. Deposited during the Late Cretaceous Epoch (Cretaceous Period) - to - Paleocene Epoch (Palaeogene Period) (100.5-56 Ma BP)."@en .
